#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 13
#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Here you can choose settings for all languages."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 21
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid ""
"Check this if you do not want to discover each instance of the same letter."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 27
#: rc.cpp:35
msgid ""
"If you check this box, only the first letter will be written if the letter "
"is found in several places in the word. Then you have to rechoose the same "
"letter, to replace the second instance in the word until there are no more "
"instances of this letter.\n"
"For example, the word to guess is \"potato\". If this option is unchecked, "
"when you try \"o\", the two instances of \"o\" in the word will be "
"discovered at the same time. If this is checked, you will need to try \"o\" "
"twice.\n"
"\n"
"Default is that for one letter typed, all instances of that letter in the "
"word are discovered."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 30
#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Require more guesses for duplicate letters"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 37
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"If checked, the congratulations dialog is not displayed. After four seconds, "
"a new game will start automatically."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 43
#: rc.cpp:47
msgid ""
"If this option is not checked, a congratulations dialog will appear when a "
"game is won. It also asks you if you want to play again.\n"
"This is the default state.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is checked, the dialog will not appear and a new game will "
"automatically be started after four seconds. A passive popup tells you that "
"you have won the game. You do not have an intrusive dialog every time you "
"win a game."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file generalui.ui line 46
#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "Do not display the congratulations dialog"
msgstr ""

